Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat(session):=20=E6=B7=BB=E5=8A=A0=E6=8C=81?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E4=B9=85=E5=8C=96=20session=20goal=20=E5=8A=9F=E8=83=BD?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E4=B8=8E=E8=87=AA=E5=8A=A8=E7=BB=AD=E8=B7=91?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

新增 session 级持久化 goal 状态机（active/paused/complete/blocked），
当 agent loop 正常结束且 goal 仍为 active 时，注入续跑 prompt 并自动
继续 loop。续跑 prompt 文本对齐 Codex continuation.md，包含 Completion
audit（8 条验证规则）、Blocked audit（3 轮连续规则 + anti-lazy-block
禁令）、Fidelity（防止缩窄目标）和 Work from evidence（检查当前状态
而非依赖记忆）等防护段落。

模型通过 goal 工具仅可标记 complete 或 blocked，不能 pause/resume/clear。
用户通过 HTTP API（GET/POST/DELETE /session/:id/goal）控制 goal 生命周期。
TUI sidebar 新增 goal 面板（状态指示 + objective + 用量），footer 显示
active/blocked 状态，消息面板以 '↻ Goal continuation' 标签渲染续跑 prompt。

功能受 experimental.goals 配置开关控制，默认关闭。续跑上限由
experimental.goal_max_turns 控制（默认 10）。subagent session 和 decide
agent 不参与 goal 续跑。

diff --git a/packages/opencode/migration/20260704053848_session_goal/migration.sql b/packages/opencode/migration/20260704053848_session_goal/migration.sql
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..b16b9574a75e6446a5b8ff82ebca8f839be8a334
--- /dev/null
+++ b/packages/opencode/migration/20260704053848_session_goal/migration.sql
@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+CREATE TABLE `session_goal` (
+	`session_id` text PRIMARY KEY,
+	`id` text NOT NULL,
+	`objective` text NOT NULL,
+	`status` text NOT NULL,
+	`token_budget` integer,
+	`tokens_used` integer DEFAULT 0 NOT NULL,
+	`time_used_seconds` integer DEFAULT 0 NOT NULL,
+	`time_created` integer NOT NULL,
+	`time_updated` integer NOT NULL,
+	CONSTRAINT `fk_session_goal_session_id_session_id_fk` FOREIGN KEY (`session_id`) REFERENCES `session`(`id`) ON DELETE CASCADE
+);
+--> statement-breakpoint
+CREATE INDEX `session_goal_status_idx` ON `session_goal` (`session_id`,`status`);
